<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - JLG Industries downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - JLG Industries downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it downgraded JLG Industries Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- The company late Monday said its fiscal third quarter earnings may not meet analysts expectations.  It also said its fiscal fourth quarter results could be impacted by recent and expected interest rate increases.</p>
<p>-- The company is on a July fiscal year.</p>
<p>-- The stock dropped 5-3/8 to 14.</p>
</text>
